# 2. PRIMARY MILESTONE OBJECTIVE

Ensure that Phumulani's community-facing workflows are understandable, navigable, accessible and operational in all seven supported languages.

The platform must support users who may have:

- Limited English proficiency.
- Limited digital literacy.
- Different cultural expectations.
- Limited access to desktop computers.
- Mobile-only internet access.
- Accessibility needs.
- Privacy and safeguarding concerns.

The goal is not merely to display translated text.

The goal is to enable community members to complete real operational tasks safely and confidently.

